# jitsi-recordings health check  (OpenTeams+ Phase 5)
#
# User crontab line (install via `crontab -e` as the user in the docker group,
# e.g. alikhan). Runs every 10 minutes, no sudo, no alerting — it only refreshes
# $STATUS_DIR/status.json + appends to health.log.

*/10 * * * * /srv/jitsi-recordings/_bin/check-health.sh
